                  {
                    "value": "Revenue YTD = the total of every Sage AR invoice dated from Jan 1 to the end of the week picked, on every Sage job - matched to a Procore project or not (job with no project = 'Counted - Sage job with no Procore project'). Voided invoices are listed and count $0. These are BILLINGS: revenue after the WIP (over / under billing) adjustment needs the Sage general ledger, not yet ingested.",
